(xiv)
the sovereignty and integrity of India is not called in question;
(xv)
the security of the State is not jeopardised or endangered;
(xvi)
friendly relations with foreign States are not strained;
(xvii)
public order is not endangered;
(xviii)
visuals or words involving defamation of an individual or a l7ody of individuals, or contempt of Court are not presented.
Explanation.-Scenes that tend to create scorn, disgrace or disregard of rules or undermine the dignity of Court will come
tinder the term "contempt of court"; and
